{"message":"After-tax cost = compensation cost + income tax benefit (using the signed benefit figures shown): 2010 = 18.1 + (-6.3) = 11.8; 2009 = 14.6 + (-5.2) = 9.4. The percentage change is (11.8 - 9.4) / 9.4, about 25.5%.","final":{"answer":"25.5% increase","value":25.53191489361702,"unit":"percent","calculation":"( (18.1 + (-6.3)) - (14.6 + (-5.2)) ) / (14.6 + (-5.2)) * 100","sources":["source:t1c1n0","source:t2c1n0","source:t1c2n0","source:t2c2n0"]}}